DESCRIPTION >
    Listed apps ranked by successful, billable Pollen Pay (BYOP) requests in
    the rolling last 7 days. A registered App Key is credited to the one
    catalog listing of the same owner whose URL covers the key's redirect URI.
    Without a URL match, it is credited to the owner's listing only when the
    owner has exactly one. Ambiguous keys are excluded. Multiple keys for one
    listing are combined before ranking. Refreshed hourly.
    Returns catalog URLs and names, public owner handles, and aggregate counts
    only. No user IDs, App Keys, wallet, revenue, or cost data is exposed.

TOKEN "tinybird_read_public" READ
TOKEN "tinybird_read" READ

NODE endpoint
SQL >
    %
    SELECT app_url, app_name, owner, request_count, last_seen
    FROM app_top_weekly_snapshot
    ORDER BY request_count DESC, last_seen DESC, app_name ASC, app_url ASC
    LIMIT {{ UInt8(limit, 10) }}

TYPE ENDPOINT
